### === Kubernetes: Secrets reais NUNCA sao versionados === ###
# Somente README.md, .gitkeep e modelos *.example.* ficam no Git.
k8s/secrets/*
!k8s/secrets/README.md
!k8s/secrets/.gitkeep
!k8s/secrets/*.example.yaml
!k8s/secrets/*.example.yml
*.secret.yaml
*.secret.yml
*-secret.local.yaml
vapid-keys.json
